WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.376 --> 00:00:03.959
(uplifting accordion tune)

00:00:06.179 --> 00:00:09.219
- We are a circus of big family tradition

00:00:09.219 --> 00:00:11.757
and the way we present
our show is the same way

00:00:11.757 --> 00:00:15.883
that my family presented
the show over 175 years ago.

00:00:15.883 --> 00:00:18.885
There's nothing fancy
about what we do here.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:21.381
It's magic, real magic.

00:00:21.381 --> 00:00:24.964
(uplifting accordion tune)

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.320
When you grow up in a circus as a child,

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:34.704
you just step into being a clown.

00:00:34.704 --> 00:00:36.704
(speaks in Italian)

00:00:36.704 --> 00:00:39.147
Welcome to the Zoppé Circus, 
thank you for coming!

00:00:39.147 --> 00:00:40.523
We're a classic family circus,

00:00:40.523 --> 00:00:42.244
which means our family's here

00:00:42.244 --> 00:00:43.942
working together, performing together.

00:00:43.942 --> 00:00:45.467
Would you like to meet some of our family?

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:46.523
- [Audience] Yeah!

00:00:46.523 --> 00:00:47.963
- First of all, there's my mother,

00:00:47.963 --> 00:00:49.467
the Matriarch of our family.

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:51.584
Then I have my sister, Carla,

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.563
who with her husband, Rudy,
they perform with their dog act.

00:00:54.563 --> 00:00:58.040
And then we have my sister, Tosca, she
has the horses on the show.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.584
but she also directs the show.

00:00:59.584 --> 00:01:03.083
Her husband, Jay, is an
amazing White Clown.

00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:04.863
The White Clown is the straight clown,

00:01:04.863 --> 00:01:08.696
he's the best White Clown
that I've ever seen.

00:01:11.099 --> 00:01:13.443
The act that my son and I
do right now on the show

00:01:13.443 --> 00:01:15.299
is actually a balloon routine.

00:01:15.299 --> 00:01:17.859
It's nothing new, I mean
it's thousands of years old,

00:01:17.859 --> 00:01:19.898
clowns have been doing it forever.

00:01:19.898 --> 00:01:21.523
It happens to be really
cute when he does it,

00:01:21.523 --> 00:01:26.088
because he's a adorable;
it's an unexplainable thing

00:01:26.088 --> 00:01:29.338
to see my child do what he loves to do.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:33.681
I mean, I get this seven-year-old, 
beautiful little boy

00:01:33.681 --> 00:01:37.848
and his heart opens up and
he gives it to everybody.

00:01:39.835 --> 00:01:43.312
It's different here, I
think than most places,

00:01:43.312 --> 00:01:45.588
when we come into this
ring, we become family.

00:01:45.588 --> 00:01:49.755
I believe circus and family
are basically the same world.

